{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANARIA: Reborn</strong> is the remake of the original <i>Anaria</i>,<br>created entirely by a solo indie developer from Moldova. \ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\udde9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version brings major improvements \u2014 realistic graphics, better optimization, an expanded story, and refined gameplay mechanics.<br>Most importantly, it includes both chapters, revealing the full story of the <i>Anaria</i> universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ANARIA: Reborn</i> takes you deep inside the fractured mind of a young girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything around you is born from her twisted imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know who she is or why she keeps you here \u2014 only that she enjoys playing with you, without ever revealing her reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to <strong>survive the nightmare you\u2019ve been dragged into \u2014 or become part of it.</strong><br>Move from room to room, guided only by the faint light of candles as darkness closes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to uncover the truth behind the story \u2014 <strong>who you are, and why time itself feels meaningless.</strong> <br>No one knows when this place was built, how long it has existed\u2026 or how long you\u2019ve already been trapped inside.<br>You should be careful whom you talk to \u2014 you\u2019ll need to figure out whether the voices in your head are friendly\u2026 or malicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>interactive mechanics</strong> \u2014 manipulate objects and environmental elements to progress through each door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also includes <strong>complex stealth mechanics:</strong><br>If something hunts you \u2014 <strong>run, hide, and pray it will not find you.</strong><br>Stay focused and <strong>be quiet... or you\u2019re dead.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Doll</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/9c8d0277c2c29907acf43c9e390aa6d6.poster.avif?t=1770948801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/9c8d0277c2c29907acf43c9e390aa6d6.webm?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/9c8d0277c2c29907acf43c9e390aa6d6.mp4?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s always following you. Always watching.<br>You talk to her \u2014 but who is she? And why does she always want to play?<br>No matter how far you run, she appears again in front of you, as if moving through dimensions.<br>She even checks the hiding spots\u2026 so be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/8c8b2dac7950c6d7565c9e2dc14fe3e7.poster.avif?t=1770948801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/8c8b2dac7950c6d7565c9e2dc14fe3e7.webm?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/8c8b2dac7950c6d7565c9e2dc14fe3e7.mp4?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clock that distorts reality \u2014 when you turn it, the world itself changes.<br>Some objects vanish, while others appear where nothing existed before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camera</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/2499fa621f073c69cc8083c6c4492285.poster.avif?t=1770948801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/2499fa621f073c69cc8083c6c4492285.webm?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/2499fa621f073c69cc8083c6c4492285.mp4?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camera that can spot anomalies \u2014 objects that shouldn\u2019t exist, or ones that are missing.<br>It can also materialize hidden things... but its battery drains fast.<br>Use it wisely.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924150?t=1770948801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924150?t=1770948801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/02bc584b96db51aee4b0dee5ee9ff583d101c4fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770948801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/02bc584b96db51aee4b0dee5ee9ff583d101c4fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770948801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature content including blood, sudden jumpscares, dark and tense atmosphere, and an enemy that can chase and catch the player. It does not contain graphic gore, sexual content, or explicit violence.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4289010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANARIA: Reborn</strong> is the remake of the original <i>Anaria</i>,<br>created entirely by a solo indie developer from Moldova. \ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\udde9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version brings major improvements \u2014 realistic graphics, better optimization, an expanded story, and refined gameplay mechanics.<br>Most importantly, it includes both chapters, revealing the full story of the <i>Anaria</i> universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ANARIA: Reborn</i> takes you deep inside the fractured mind of a young girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything around you is born from her twisted imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know who she is or why she keeps you here \u2014 only that she enjoys playing with you, without ever revealing her reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to <strong>survive the nightmare you\u2019ve been dragged into \u2014 or become part of it.</strong><br>Move from room to room, guided only by the faint light of candles as darkness closes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to uncover the truth behind the story \u2014 <strong>who you are, and why time itself feels meaningless.</strong> <br>No one knows when this place was built, how long it has existed\u2026 or how long you\u2019ve already been trapped inside.<br>You should be careful whom you talk to \u2014 you\u2019ll need to figure out whether the voices in your head are friendly\u2026 or malicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers <strong>interactive mechanics</strong> \u2014 manipulate objects and environmental elements to progress through each door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also includes <strong>complex stealth mechanics:</strong><br>If something hunts you \u2014 <strong>run, hide, and pray it will not find you.</strong><br>Stay focused and <strong>be quiet... or you\u2019re dead.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Doll</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/9c8d0277c2c29907acf43c9e390aa6d6.poster.avif?t=1770948801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/9c8d0277c2c29907acf43c9e390aa6d6.webm?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/9c8d0277c2c29907acf43c9e390aa6d6.mp4?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s always following you. Always watching.<br>You talk to her \u2014 but who is she? And why does she always want to play?<br>No matter how far you run, she appears again in front of you, as if moving through dimensions.<br>She even checks the hiding spots\u2026 so be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/8c8b2dac7950c6d7565c9e2dc14fe3e7.poster.avif?t=1770948801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/8c8b2dac7950c6d7565c9e2dc14fe3e7.webm?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/8c8b2dac7950c6d7565c9e2dc14fe3e7.mp4?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clock that distorts reality \u2014 when you turn it, the world itself changes.<br>Some objects vanish, while others appear where nothing existed before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camera</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/2499fa621f073c69cc8083c6c4492285.poster.avif?t=1770948801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/2499fa621f073c69cc8083c6c4492285.webm?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/extras/2499fa621f073c69cc8083c6c4492285.mp4?t=1770948801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A camera that can spot anomalies \u2014 objects that shouldn\u2019t exist, or ones that are missing.<br>It can also materialize hidden things... but its battery drains fast.<br>Use it wisely.</p>","developers":["VOIDEMBER"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924150/6c2fc006fc54651eb91346cdc6ec48ac135f00a9/header.jpg?t=1770948801","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 ANGLEBLOOD. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThis game contains materials used under license. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924150/888719286/d9f4d8c747557692b62d181ca56fd9b973a8a249/1760812816/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760878857","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924150/888719286/d9f4d8c7475